e total number of ways to seat the 6 girls and 2 boys in a row with the boys sitting next to each other is \\(\\boxed{10080}\\)."},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{10080}","correct":true,"format":"boxed","parseable":true},"id":"counting_and_probability:254"}
